# ─── runtime / per-install state ────────────────────────────────────────
# These files are written by the hook and the dashboard at run time. They
# are per-install and must NEVER be committed: a tracked audit.jsonl gets
# checked out over the user's live log on every `git pull`, silently
# destroying their decision history.
audit.jsonl
audit-*.jsonl
audit-*.jsonl.gz
baseline.json
dashboard.pid
dashboard.log
pending/

# ─── threat feed cache ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# update_threat_feed.py downloads OSV.dev MAL-* advisories. Stored locally,
# refreshed on schedule, not source.
threat_feed*.json
compromised_packages*.json

# ─── per-user tuning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# rules_user.py is generated by `tune.py review`. Per-install customisation.
rules_user.py

# ─── python build / bytecode ────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/

# ─── editor / OS / tooling artifacts ────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.playwright-mcp/
